Donning a captain's hat,

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:32.680
to welcome friends and girlfriends aboard.

00:38:37.540 --> 00:38:41.420
Ripley's personal life was as unconventional as his chosen career.

00:38:42.410 --> 00:38:44.490
and the eccentric artists pursued both.

00:38:45.160 --> 00:38:45.620
with gusto.

00:38:53.580 --> 00:38:55.800
