00:41:27.310 --> 00:41:29.890
When the Chicago Fair closed, Rip

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:38.740
Ripley was invited to restage his show at a new exposition opening in San Diego, but there his lineup met with resistance.

00:41:40.180 --> 00:41:50.710
A California judge fined Ripley's company for including performers like Frida Pushnik, citing a state law prohibiting the exhibit of so-called deformed persons.

00:41:52.440 --> 00:41:59.840
Ripley himself refused to use the term freak to describe his cast members and reportedly threatened to fire anyone.

