We know our daily lives where everything operates in a predictable kind of way and the people that we know behave all in the same kind of way.

00:43:22.940 --> 00:43:26.000
His idea was to say, you ain't seen nothing.

00:43:29.290 --> 00:43:29.910
This world.

00:43:30.000 --> 00:43:34.100
